<title>PHILIPPINES: GPU unit takes stake in Ultrana unit.</title>
<headline>GPU unit takes stake in Ultrana unit.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>GPU Power Philippines Inc, a unit of GPU Inc, has signed an agreement giving it a 40 percent stake in Magellan Utilities Development Corp, a unit of Ultrana Energy and Resources Corp, Megallan said on Friday.  </p>
<p>Magellan said GPU Power will be technical manager for Magellan's 300-megawatt coal-fired power plant to be built in Batangas, south of Manila.</p>
<p>Magellan said the plant's entire output will be sold to the Manila Electric Co.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
